<title>BELGIUM: Tractebel merger, stock split on Oct 10.</title>
<headline>Tractebel merger, stock split on Oct 10.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The merger between utility holding company Tractebel SA and its Powerin unit, which was approved by shareholders on Thursday, and a planned five-for-one stock split at Tractebel will take place on October 10, Tractebel said.</p>
<p>A Tractebel official told Reuters at the meeting of Tractebel shareholders, that on October 10 Powerfin shareholders would receive five split Tractebel shares for three Powerfin shares.</p>
<p>He added the Powerfin share would remain listed until the end of 1997 in order to allow Powerfin shareholders to bring the number of Powerfin shares in their portfolio to a multiple of three.</p>
